    {
     "tool_use_id": "toolu_01TzXkjHvrzmrLcLvFQWyjEn",
     "type": "tool_result",
     "content": "{\"segments\":[{\"id\":1,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":0,\"kind\":\"heading\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"reviewed\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18 07:35:45\",\"sourceText\":\"Chapter I\",\"targetText\":\"1장\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":2,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":1,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"draft\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18 07:35:45\",\"sourceText\":\"In my younger and more vulnerable years my father gave me some advice that I've been turning over in my mind ever since.\",\"targetText\":\"지금보다 어리고 쉽게 상처받던 시절, 아버지가 내게 해 주신 충고가 있는데 나는 그 뒤로 줄곧 그 말을 곱씹어 왔다.\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":3,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":2,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"untranslated\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18 07:35:45\",\"sourceText\":\"“Whenever you feel like criticizing any one,” he told me, “just remember that all the people in this world haven't had the advantages that you've had.”\",\"targetText\":\"\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":4,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":3,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"untranslated\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18 07:35:45\",\"sourceText\":\"He didn't say any more, but we've always been unusually communicative in a reserved way, and I understood that he meant a great deal more than that. In consequence, I'm inclined to reserve all judgments, a habit that has opened up many curious natures to me and also made me the victim of not a few veteran bores.\",\"targetText\":\"\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[{\"id\":1,\"parentId\":null,\"side\":\"source\",\"body\":\"앞 문장의 reserved와 말장난? 둘을 같은 말로 받을지 고민\",\"resolved\":false,\"quote\":\"reserve all judgments\"}],\"terms\":[]},{\"id\":5,\"chapterId\":1,\"idx\":4,\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"pageStart\":1,\"pageEnd\":1,\"status\":\"untranslated\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-10-18 07:35:45\",\"sourceText\":\"The abnormal mind is quick to detect and attach itself to this quality when it appears in a normal person, and so it came about that in college I was unjustly accused of being a politician, because I was privy to the secret griefs of wild, unknown men.\",\"targetText\":\"\",\"notes\":[],\"comments\":[],\"terms\":[]}]}"
    }
   ]
